Paste your full cookie string from shopee.vn here, then save this file as cookies.txt
(cookies.txt is gitignored).

How to get the cookie string (Chrome / Edge):

  1. Open https://shopee.vn in a normal browser tab.
  2. Make sure the page loads completely. Do a small action like scrolling
     and clicking on a category - this triggers the anti-bot to issue
     a full cookie set including SPC_F (device fingerprint).
  3. Press F12 to open DevTools.
  4. Go to the Console tab.
  5. Paste this and press Enter:

         copy(document.cookie)

     The cookie string is now on your clipboard.
  6. Paste it into a new file named cookies.txt in this folder
     (next to Program.cs).

The string looks like (one line, semicolons separate cookies):

  SPC_F=abc123...; REC_T_ID=xxx; csrftoken=xxx; SPC_EC=xxx; SPC_U=xxx; ...

Important:
  - Do NOT commit cookies.txt - .gitignore already excludes it.
  - Cookies expire after a few days; if you start getting 403 again, refresh.
  - Use a "clean" browser profile or guest window so your real account
    cookies are not mixed in. The crawler should be anonymous.
